{"ticker":"CNC","updated":"2026-10-30T22:41:09Z","profile":{"longName":"Centene Corporation","shortName":"Centene Corporation","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Healthcare Plans","country":"United States","website":"https://www.centene.com","fullTimeEmployees":61100,"marketCap":33887404032,"trailingPE":23.522335,"forwardPE":12.510577,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.18783654,"pegRatio":0.83,"targetMeanPrice":74.5,"targetHighPrice":85.0,"targetLowPrice":56.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":18,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.002,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.113409996,"operatingMargins":0.0074199997,"profitMargins":0.008090001,"totalRevenue":180409008128,"beta":1.13,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":72.5,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":31.63,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Centene Corporation operates as a managed care company that provides programs and services to under-insured families, and commercial organizations in the United States. It operates through four segments: Medicaid, Medicare, Commercial, and Other. The Medicaid segment offers the temporary assistance for needy families; medicaid expansion; aged, blind, or disabled; and children's health insurance programs, as well as long-term services and supports; foster care; and medicare-medicaid plans. This segment also provides healthcare products and services. The Medicare segment offers special needs and medicare supplement, and prescription drug plans. The Commercial segment provides health insurance marketplace product for individual and commercial group. The Other segment operates clinical healthcare and pharmacies, as well as offers vision and dental, behavioral health, and centralized services. It provides services through primary and specialty care physicians, hospitals, behavioral health practitioners, and ancillary providers. The company was founded in 1984 and is headquartered in Saint Louis, Missouri.","summary_zh":"Centene Corporation 作為一家管理式醫療公司運營，為美國保險不足的家庭和商業組織提供計劃和服務。它透過四個部門運作：醫療補助部門、醫療保險部門、商業部門和其他部門。醫療補助部分為有需要的家庭提供臨時援助；醫療補助擴大；老年、失明或殘疾；和兒童健康保險計劃，以及長期服務和支持；寄養；和醫療保險-醫療補助計劃。該部門也提供醫療保健產品和服務。醫療保險部門提供特殊需求和醫療保險補充以及處方藥計劃。商業部門為個人和商業團體提供健康保險市場產品。其他部門經營臨床醫療保健和藥房，並提供視力和牙科、行為健康和集中服務。它透過初級和專科護理醫生、醫院、行為健康從業者和輔助提供者提供服務。該公司成立於 1984 年，總部位於密蘇裡州聖路易斯。","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"醫療保健計劃","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":29.13,"h":29.79,"l":28.72,"c":29.62,"v":10033700},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":29.5,"h":30.06,"l":29.42,"c":30.06,"v":11693700},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":29.25,"h":29.3,"l":28.26,"c":28.65,"v":23984700},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":28.59,"h":29.13,"l":28.24,"c":28.98,"v":14113700},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":29.02,"h":29.07,"l":28.33,"c":28.84,"v":16102400},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":29.15,"h":31.15,"l":28.84,"c":31.06,"v":22476700},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":31.01,"h":31.34,"l":29.98,"c":31.27,"v":14265600},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":35.97,"h":36.14,"l":34.07,"c":34.08,"v":36452700},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":33.92,"h":34.78,"l":33.07,"c":33.26,"v":16869700},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":33.24,"h":33.44,"l":31.93,"c":32.64,"v":11585800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":32.76,"h":32.96,"l":31.77,"c":31.8,"v":10632900},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":32.08,"h":32.63,"l":31.73,"c":32.02,"v":8889500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":32.24,"h":32.91,"l":31.93,"c":32.17,"v":7020200},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":32.29,"h":32.31,"l":31.74,"c":31.77,"v":21240600},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":31.67,"h":32.88,"l":31.65,"c":32.7,"v":9254400},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":32.91,"h":33.52,"l":32.72,"c":32.75,"v":9423600},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":32.73,"h":34.85,"l":32.59,"c":34.65,"v":16526500},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":34.49,"h":34.7,"l":33.62,"c":34.39,"v":15097200},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":34.62,"h":35.42,"l":34.44,"c":34.86,"v":13616600},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":34.7,"h":35.3,"l":34.41,"c":35.21,"v":8292100},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":35.22,"h":35.81,"l":34.96,"c":35.68,"v":9080800},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":35.75,"h":36.2,"l":35.48,"c":35.74,"v":7246100},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":35.71,"h":37.0,"l":35.58,"c":36.82,"v":9820900},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":36.